0248: the carve-outs XNU does not manage, packed into 0xa4000000..0xaa000000, so XNU's RAM can start at
0xaa000000 (tools/mkadt.py DRAM_BASE; was 0xf4000000): 3392 MiB instead of 2208 MiB. Memory pressure stayed at
warning with Camera open and held back Photos' thumbnail jobs. 0xa2000000..0xa4000000 stays free for the sensors.
  GPU pool     0xc0000000 -> 0xa4000000 (32 MiB; window now 0xa4000000..0xaa000000)
  camera ring  0xd0000000 -> 0xa6000000 (16 MiB)
  radio pool   0xe0000000 -> 0xa7000000 (16 MiB)
  audio shm    0xe1000000 -> 0xa8000000 (64 KiB)
  modem mdata  0xf2600000 -> 0xa8100000 (16 KiB)
  rmtfs        0xf2701000 -> 0xa8201000 (2 MiB)
